      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Upon further review of the live release of the nameplate changes, it also seems that the user profile icon has inherited this behavior of being ever so slightly transparent. Since the text and other icons on the nameplate are fully opaque, I believe that the profile icon and status icon should be as well.\n\nThe only exception to this is the group banner, which is partially transparent and should stay that way, as it makes it much less intrusive at 0% nameplate opacity.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-08-11T22:18:58.736Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When setting the opacity to 0%, the status icon itself becomes partially transparent. It should be fully opaque even with the background hidden, not partially transparent.",
